      "core_meaning_cn": "构成更大整体的一个成员/部分：在人群中可指选民，在结构中可指组成成分，在语法中可指句法成分",
      "core_meaning_en": "a part of a whole or a voter",
      "mental_model_cn": "district → constituent = 被代表的选民；whole/system → constituent part = 组成部分；grammar → constituent = 构成更大句法结构的成分。",
      "mental_model_en": "A constituent is one unit that helps make a larger whole, whether a voter, component, or grammatical unit."
